## Skills

Detailed workflows live in `.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md`. Each skill is loaded on-demand via the Skill tool.

**Always available:**
- `cross-source-queries` — Pattern detection (intention-reality gaps, commitments, convergence)
- `weekly-reflection` — Qualitative narrative from all sources
- `data-sync` — Orchestrate data source syncs
{% if notes_app != 'none' -%}
- `draft-coach` — Socratic Q&A writing assistance
- `stale-drafts` — Draft queue ranking
{%- endif %}

**Source-specific (loaded based on `vault.toml`):**
{% if enable_email -%}
- `email-ingest` — Sync mail via mbsync + notmuch
- `email-analyzer` — Query email archive
{% endif -%}
{% if enable_browser -%}
- `browser-ingest` — Import browser history
- `session-analyzer` — Tab workspace health
{% endif -%}
{% if enable_journal -%}
- `journal-ingest` — Parse journal exports
{% endif -%}
{% if enable_tasks -%}
- `tasks-import` — Sync task manager
{% endif %}

**Architecture:**
- Skills import shared helpers from `.claude/skills/_lib/` (`vault_config.py` for paths, `SCHEMAS.md` for data contracts)
- Ingest skills write to normalized SQLite databases in `data/` (`journal.db`, `tasks.db`, `browser-history.db`){% if split %} under the content root{% endif %}
- Analysis skills read from those databases — they're decoupled from how data was ingested
- LLM-powered skills use `pydantic-ai`: weekly-reflection requires `OPENAI_API_KEY`; stale-drafts optionally uses `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` and falls back to heuristic ranking
- Store secrets in the 1Password `Development` vault; `.env` contains `op://Development/<item>/credential` references
- Run credential-dependent skills with `op run --env-file=.env -- uv run <script>`; use `--project .claude/skills/<skill>` for skills with a `pyproject.toml`
- Resolve secrets per call only: there is no dotenv `.envrc`, and `.env` is never exported into the shell. Skills that need no secret (e.g. `data-sync`{% if enable_tasks and task_provider == 'todoist' %} without Todoist{% endif %}) run with plain `uv run`
